# Laid out Medium on an opened fold's inner screen upright (MBUI_WIN=690x840 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2), a finger: the
# tape's edge (sfdesk frame.mbt tape_edge) between the one in use and the page. The sidebar's dragged 120 wider (the page
# beside it showing less); the page brought over, a chat's side panel opened (as wide as the window leaves past a strip
# of the page) and its edge dragged 220 narrower (the page beside it showing more).
system {"size_class":{"width":"medium","height":"medium"}}
timeout 20000
until 新建对话
wait 600
drag 325 420 120 0 700
wait 900
tapxy -24 420
wait 900
tap icon:panel-open
wait 1200
drag 48 420 220 0 700
wait 1200
exit
